but there's a lot more to look into later.

00:19:08.270 --> 00:19:11.165
So I had this very general
Venn diagram to get started.

00:19:11.165 --> 00:19:13.793
And it just shows the Hollywood
special effects now.

00:19:13.793 --> 00:19:15.730
You're sort of mixing in
a lot of different things.

00:19:15.730 --> 00:19:20.300
You've always had rendering and
graphics, geometry and

00:19:20.300 --> 00:19:23.640
graphics, animation and graphics,
that's always been there.

00:19:23.640 --> 00:19:25.680
And more recently,
physical simulation has come in.

00:19:25.680 --> 00:19:30.650
That's something that has come in
the last 20 years and even more recently,

00:19:30.650 --> 00:19:32.470
computer vision is playing
