00:48:59.270 --> 00:49:06.250
that work on computer tomography,
that work on MRI scanning.

00:49:06.250 --> 00:49:11.050
Throughout the medical imaging technique
use very similar principles and

00:49:11.050 --> 00:49:13.140
very similar algorithms.

00:49:13.140 --> 00:49:17.831
And even though I don't think
anybody of us is directly working

00:49:17.831 --> 00:49:21.901
on cancer research,
a lot of the techniques may be able

00:49:21.901 --> 00:49:26.254
to help discover new things
[COUGH] in those fields as well.

