how some of the stuff in geometry,

00:50:49.340 --> 00:50:51.690
which isn't ready,
can be proved with simulation, and

00:50:51.690 --> 00:50:54.020
some of simulations that present
ready can be improved with geometry.

00:50:54.020 --> 00:50:55.700
So there's a real back and
forth between that.

00:50:55.700 --> 00:50:59.530
Convolutional networks are really
finding a basis for things.

00:50:59.530 --> 00:51:04.900
You have things like autoencoders or
what-not for a piece of cloth, let's say.

00:51:04.900 --> 00:51:07.720
What is a good basis of representation for
that cloth?

00:51:07.720 --> 00:51:10.869
You could try doing Fourier analysis and
finding sine waves of the folds.

00:51:10.869 --> 00:51:13.958
Or you could do a convolutional network or
an auto-encode.

00:51:13.958 --> 00:51:15.060
There's many ways of doing that.

00:51:15.060 --> 00:51:16.580
But these are, I think,

00:51:16.580 --> 00:51:20.790
two really big things importantly
